},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"每个主要的区块链都代表了不同的工程决策和权衡，这些决策和权衡受我们所了解的基本约束所影响。","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":168},"end":{"line":7,"column":46,"offset":213}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":168},"end":{"line":7,"column":46,"offset":213}}},{"type":"mdxJsxFlowElement","name":"ArticleSection","attributes":[{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"name","value":"Bitcoin","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":17,"offset":233},"end":{"line":9,"column":31,"offset":247}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"id","value":"bitcoin","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":32,"offset":248},"end":{"line":9,"column":44,"offset":260}}},{"type":"mdxJsxAttribute","name":"level","value":"h2","position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":45,"offset":261},"end":{"line":9,"column":55,"offset":271}}}],"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":9,"column":1,"offset":217},"end":{"line":9,"column":58,"offset":274}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"比特币并不是为了成为通用计算机而设计的；它的目标是解决一个特定的问题：创建一种无需银行或政府运作的数字货币。比特币的每一个设计决策都反映了这一单一目标。","position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":278},"end":{"line":11,"column":77,"offset":354}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":11,"column":1,"offset":278},"end":{"line":11,"column":77,"offset":354}}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"children":[{"type":"text","value":"共识","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":5,"offset":362},"end":{"line":13,"column":7,"offset":364}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1,"offset":358},"end":{"line":13,"column":7,"offset":364}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"比特币使用了中本聪设计的原始工作量证明（Proof of Work）实现。矿工们竞争寻找一个随机数（nonce），当与区块数据一起哈希时，会生成一个以特定数量的零开头的哈希值。","position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":368},"end":{"line":15,"column":89,"offset":456}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":15,"column":1,"offset":368},"end":{"line":15,"column":89,"offset":456}}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"网络每隔 2,016 个区块（大约两周）会自动调整难度，以保持平均区块时间